---
// The ten-question flow (G-08) and the patente estimator it surfaces
// (G-09), followed by the process overview diagram (G-10) and the step
// cards' agency/timing/cost/blocks fields (G-11, rendered client-side in
// src/scripts/tool.ts). Content is server-rendered from content/*.yaml —
// only the question panel needs client JS. The municipal comparison table
// (G-12) is a later ticket; this page currently ends where the diagram's
// figcaption does.
import { loadContent } from '../lib/load-content';
import ProcessDiagram from '../components/ProcessDiagram.astro';

const content = await loadContent();

// Embedded so the client script has content immediately, with no extra
// request race against G-04's published content.json (that asset is for
// cud-agente, a different consumer with a different lifecycle — fetching
// it here would just be a second, slower copy of what SSR already has).
// `<`-escaping keeps a literal `</script>` inside any note's HTML
// from ever being able to close this tag early.
const contentJson = JSON.stringify(content).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
---

<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Guía de Apertura de Negocios en Puerto Rico</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Newsreader:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="masthead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Guía práctica, no asesoría legal</p>
      <h1>Guía de Apertura de Negocios en Puerto Rico</h1>
      <p class="dek">
        Contesta hasta diez preguntas y arma tu propia secuencia — agencia, plazo y costo por
        cada paso — con los incentivos y la patente municipal que te tocan.
      </p>
    </header>

    <main class="tool">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">1</span>
        <h2>Tu ruta</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-dek">
        La secuencia de abajo es igual para todo el mundo. Lo que cambia es qué ramas te aplican,
        cuánto te cuesta la patente de verdad, y cuáles incentivos existen y cuáles son cuento de
        internet.
      </p>
      <div class="tool-grid">
        <div class="questions" data-questions>
          {
            content.questions.map((q) => (
              <div class="question" data-question={q.id}>
                <div class="question-head">
                  <span class="question-num">{q.order}</span>
                  <label class="question-label">{q.label.es}</label>
                </div>
                {q.hint && <p class="question-hint">{q.hint.es}</p>}
                {q.input === 'options' && (
                  <div class="options" role="group" aria-label={q.label.es}>
                    {q.options?.map((o) => (
                      <button type="button" class="option" data-option={o.value}>
                        {o.label.es}
                      </button>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
                {q.input === 'select' && (
                  <select aria-label={q.label.es}>
                    <option value="">—</option>
                    {q.options?.map((o) => <option value={o.value}>{o.label.es}</option>)}
                  </select>
                )}
                {q.input === 'number' && (
                  <input type="number" min="0" step="1" aria-label={q.label.es} />
                )}
              </div>
            ))
          }
          <button type="button" class="start-over" data-start-over>
            Empezar de nuevo
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="results">
          <div class="empty-state" data-empty-state>
            Contesta al menos tres preguntas para ver tu secuencia.
          </div>
          <div class="results-content" data-results hidden>
            <div class="at-a-glance" data-glance></div>
            <section>
              <h2>Tu secuencia</h2>
              <ol class="sequence" data-sequence></ol>
            </section>
            <section>
              <h2>Incentivos aplicables</h2>
              <div class="incentives" data-incentives></div>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section class="diagram-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">2</span>
        <h2>La forma del proceso</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-dek">
        Dos cadenas corren en paralelo y terminan en un solo permiso. La de arriba es papeleo:
        días, y casi gratis. La de abajo es la que se lleva los meses.
      </p>
      <figure class="diagram-figure">
        <div class="diagram-frame">
          <ProcessDiagram />
        </div>
        <figcaption>
          Las dos cadenas son independientes hasta que se encuentran. Lo que la gente hace mal es
          la flecha marcada en ámbar: el Certificado de Registro de Comerciante es un
          <em>insumo</em> de la solicitud de permiso, así que quien deja Hacienda para el final
          descubre que no puede radicar. Las obligaciones municipales y patronales cuelgan del
          mismo punto pero no bloquean nada — la patente se notifica <em>después</em> de empezar,
          no antes.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <script type="application/json" id="tool-content" set:html={contentJson} is:inline />
    <script src="../scripts/tool.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #f4f2ed;
    --surface: #fbfaf7;
    --ink: #16191c;
    --ink-2: #4b5259;
    --ink-3: #7a828a;
    --rule: #cfcbc2;
    --rule-soft: #e2ded6;
    --sello: #0d5c63;
    --ambar: #b96a00;
    --derogado: #c22b20;
    --verificado: #1f7a55;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --paper: #14171b;
      --surface: #1b1f24;
      --ink: #e8e6e1;
      --ink-2: #a9afb6;
      --ink-3: #79818a;
      --rule: #333a43;
      --rule-soft: #272d35;
      --sello: #5fb8bf;
      --ambar: #d9a441;
      --derogado: #e58080;
      --verificado: #6bb894;
    }
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Newsreader', serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .masthead {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 44px 24px 32px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sello);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .dek {
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tool {
    padding: 32px 24px 64px;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .tool-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 330px 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .tool-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .questions {
    position: sticky;
    top: 24px;
    align-self: start;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
    padding-right: 4px;
  }
  .question[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .question-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .question-num {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sello);
  }
  .question-label {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .question-hint {
    margin: 6px 0 0 26px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .options {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 10px 0 0 26px;
  }
  .option {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      border-color 0.12s,
      background 0.12s,
      color 0.12s;
  }
  .option:hover {
    border-color: var(--sello);
  }
  .option:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--sello);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .option.is-selected {
    background: var(--sello);
    border-color: var(--sello);
    color: var(--surface);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  select,
  input[type='number'] {
    margin: 10px 0 0 26px;
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: calc(100% - 26px);
  }
  .start-over {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .start-over:hover {
    border-color: var(--sello);
    color: var(--sello);
  }

  .results {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .empty-state {
    border: 1px dashed var(--rule);
    padding: 64px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .results-content[hidden],
  .empty-state[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .at-a-glance {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  /* `:global()` below: everything rendered inside `[data-glance]`,
     `[data-sequence]`, and `[data-incentives]` is built client-side via
     `innerHTML` in src/scripts/tool.ts, so Astro never sees these elements
     in the template and never stamps them with the scoping attribute this
     component's other rules rely on — an unscoped selector here is a
     no-op, not a mistake. */
  :global(.glance-cell) {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  :global(.glance-cell:not(:first-child)) {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }
  :global(.glance-label) {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  :global(.glance-value) {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  :global(.glance-sub) {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  :global(.glance-muni-note) {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  /* Sourcing marks (G-15's sourcing axis). `unverified` is the loudest of
     the two shown here; `primary` gets no mark at all, since an unmarked
     figure is the confirmed default. */
  :global(.mark) {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 2px 5px;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
  :global(.mark-secondary) {
    color: var(--ambar);
  }
  :global(.mark-unverified) {
    color: var(--derogado);
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 28px);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .sequence {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  :global(.step) {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }
  :global(.step[data-severity='key']) {
    border-left-color: var(--sello);
  }
  :global(.step[data-severity='warn']) {
    border-left-color: var(--ambar);
  }
  :global(.step[data-severity='stop']) {
    border-left-color: var(--derogado);
  }
  :global(.step-num) {
    flex: 0 0 30px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--sello);
  }
  :global(.step-title) {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  :global(.step-meta) {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  :global(.step-blocks) {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--sello);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  :global(.step-blocks b) {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  :global(.step-note) {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0;
  }
  :global(.step-note a) {
    color: var(--sello);
  }

  .incentives {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  :global(.incentive-card) {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--verificado);
    padding: 4px 0 4px 12px;
  }
  :global(.incentive-card h4) {
    font-family: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  :global(.incentive-card p) {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .diagram-section {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 54px 24px 60px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .section-num {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sello);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section-dek {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0 0 30px 27px;
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .diagram-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .diagram-frame {
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .diagram-figure figcaption {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 76ch;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
